{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1jdu27scwEKLDxMD8T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: build the normalisation fix now, and don't make the survey a gate.**\n\n**Why**\n- You already have behavioural evidence, which is stronger than stated satisfaction. 18% of searches return nothing, the top zero-result terms are mostly formatting variants of part numbers, and sales logs about 340 \"can't find part online\" calls a month.\n- The cost is about three days, and the change is easy to reverse. A survey would take longer and cost more than the fix. It would also tell you less than the logs, because customers describe \"search\" vaguely and won't pinpoint dash handling.\n- The head of sales' instinct to validate is fine, but the survey is the wrong tool here. It can't change the decision.\n\n**Before shipping (about half a day)**\n- Check what share of all zero-result volume the top 200 terms cover.\n- Sample 50 of those terms and confirm that the normalised form exists in the catalogue. Some may be parts you don't stock, and the fix won't help with those.\n- Record baselines: zero-result rate, the monthly count of \"can't find part\" calls, and search-to-basket conversion.\n\n**After shipping**\n- Re-measure after 2–4 weeks. Reasonable success looks like a large drop in the zero-result rate and a clear fall in the call tag. Set the threshold up front.\n- Then look at what's left. Remaining zero-results (cross-references, descriptions, misspellings, unstocked parts) are the right subject for targeted customer interviews or a short survey. That survey would also be better aimed than one run today.\n\n**Caveat:** the call tag may include other causes, such as missing products or poor filters. The post-fix numbers will show how much of the 340 was really about part-number matching."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3446,"cache_read_input_tokens":5035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3446},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6158c664-a06e-41f5-811f-ebd608c44b21","uuid":"32f6a597-abeb-4a62-8232-1c5a8e82c490","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:16:05.405Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1jdXgso3PBQtkmEhnV"}
